"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The legendary country music singer died surrounded by loved ones after bravely facing cancer, her representatives said.\",            \"english_title\": \"Country Singer Passes Away\",            \"translated_version\": \"La famosa cantante de m\u00fasica country muri\u00f3 rodeada de sus seres queridos despu\u00e9s de enfrentar valientemente el c\u00e1ncer, dijeron sus representantes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Cantante de Country Fallece\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The latest escalation in an ongoing trade war between the US and Canada will see new taxes on goods from steel to furniture, fresh tuna, and makeup.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trade War Escalation\",            \"translated_version\": \"La \u00faltima escalada en una guerra comercial entre EE.UU. y Canad\u00e1 ver\u00e1 nuevos impuestos en productos desde acero hasta muebles, at\u00fan fresco y maquillaje.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Escalada de Guerra Comercial\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A new study says at least one in four ex-NFL players who died between 2016 and 2021 had a brain disease, but the real number could be much higher.\",            \"english_title\": \"NFL Players and Brain Disease\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un nuevo estudio dice que al menos uno de cada cuatro exjugadores de la NFL que murieron entre 2016 y 2021 ten\u00eda una enfermedad cerebral, pero el n\u00famero real podr\u00eda ser mucho mayor.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Jugadores de NFL y Enfermedad Cerebral\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The US has threatened to isolate countries that keep doing business with Tehran, which sells a lot of its oil to Beijing.\",            \"english_title\": \"US Threatens Isolation\",            \"translated_version\": \"EE.UU. ha amenazado con aislar a los pa\u00edses que siguen haciendo negocios con Teher\u00e1n, que vende mucho de su petr\u00f3leo a Pek\u00edn.\",            \"translated_title\": \"EE.UU. Amenaza con Aislamiento\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The armed forces want to take over the land near Musk\u00f6 Naval Base because of threats from Russian drones.\",            \"english_title\": \"Military Land Takeover\",            \"translated_version\": \"Las fuerzas armadas quieren tomar el terreno cerca de la Base Naval Musk\u00f6 por amenazas de drones rusos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Toma de Terreno Militar\"        }    ]}"